    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1318" root="انث" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَاثَةٌ</span></b>  [inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنُثَ</span>, q. v.:] The <i>female,</i> or
<i>feminine, nature,</i> or <i>quality,</i> or <i>gender;</i> (M;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُنُوثَةٌ</span></b> . (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (tropical:)  The <i>quality of land
which is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنِيثَةٌ</span>. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [(tropical:)  <i>Softness</i> of iron:
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنيثٌ</span>.]

